    "detailed_description": "ExtremeOvertake,racing car.The game includes multiple perspectives, allowing players to travel around the world from a top-down perspective and appreciate the rich, colorful, and distinctive scenery.If the player drives the vehicle off the track, they can quickly reset it back to the track.<br />\r\nTwo modes can choose<br />\r\nRacing mode<br />\r\nYou can choose the map and stage, change the number of computer players, and compete<br />\r\nSeason mode<br />\r\nIn one season, four stages of competition, try to overtake from the 101st place to the first place<br />\r\nWinning the game can get bonuses, and the bonuses can unlock vehicles, and the color of the vehicle can be customized at will.<br />\r\nFive map can challenge.",
